{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_title", "source_sha256": "37195265dc4687682c7efe753243e8ea445b689d59bb6b53b3230766d93ee96e", "ja": "杏奈と舞台裏", "zh": "杏奈与后台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7b78847d7776ea7f0f0fc1bbce0890d52e749b5b70b5850cdb6f5ac400bcc0df", "ja": "杏奈との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "这是与杏奈在舞台后台的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_1000_null", "source_sha256": "f27cd4f6bc18f2a2e99ba865d4211e0420b17322d05aa926bb1620f2dc4b767f", "ja": "―ツアー本番直前　新人アイドルとのミーティング―", "zh": "——巡演正式开始前　与新人偶像的会议——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "25e5a03013384e54455ef5c106d877d813ad487621224b2af32d0ebeff0691cb", "ja": "プロデューサーさん……。\n杏奈、先輩たちみたいに……なれます、か？", "zh": "制作人……。\n杏奈也能……变得像前辈们那样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "ed5c10bd9c44f1f5572085d7ac1909146f2037b01300bffa07879b2b10d14d76", "ja": "え？　……どうしたんだ？\n合同レッスンで何かあったのか？", "zh": "诶？……怎么了？\n联合训练时发生什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "0e030fb3fade97aace1be3bc0085c287bbcf5fd58f726e7faf378a6d01c0704d", "ja": "んと……。先輩たち、オフの時も、キラキラしてて……\nでも、杏奈は……こんな感じ、だから……。", "zh": "那个……前辈们在私底下，也闪闪发光的……\n可是，杏奈却……是这个样子，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "121ba58c7f4ecfde47f1d53bf6d22639dc4314cc9ddd12aeb8462affa72b473c", "ja": "そ、そっか……。うん、すごい先輩を毎日見てると、\n不安にもなるよな……わかる。すごくわかる……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……嗯，每天都看着那么厉害的前辈，确实也会感到不安啊……我懂。真的特别懂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "b3a562d32bdd92d5d3129629f4b40e7fc126e3c6ffd40f3656abf35c47eda9bc", "ja": "……？　プロデューサーさんも？", "zh": "……？制作人也会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "0ce43324c9e20a5ff1138c6796bb43c824538de6954269db63d184210c7f3854", "ja": "でも、よく考えてみてほしいんだ！　杏奈がなりたい\nのは、先輩たち……みたいな、『アイドル』だよな？", "zh": "不过，你可要好好想一想！杏奈想成为的，是像前辈们那样的……“偶像”，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "666e887bb23b4380556d2d891de3b443247fe8a3d5abfd13691271fe0f83d6fb", "ja": "……です。ステージで、キラキラしてて……、あ。", "zh": "……是的。在舞台上，闪闪发光的……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "50c0476d155dafaacd4cd6190b7d19190272f5f4a0eb643bcc5c899209433c50", "ja": "うん。ステージで思いっきり輝くアイドル。\n絶対なれると思う！　オフは今のままでも……。", "zh": "嗯。在舞台上尽情绽放光芒的偶像。\n我觉得你一定能成为！平时的样子就算保持现在这样也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "3957b59c5df8a830a8d57fb99499bacc0b4cd87fafa805d91d4cc44fb02faa7a", "ja": "いや、今のままがいいと思うんだ。普段は大人しくても\nレッスンではしっかりスイッチ入れて頑張れてるし。", "zh": "不，我觉得保持现在这样就很好。平时虽然比较安静，但在训练时也能好好切换状态，努力练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "586e5bb9888c886b7aa39b08fabb29a3bb3425b7abedb9cf1222094c51e416e3", "ja": "そんな杏奈らしい、杏奈だけのアイドルに\nなれるように。一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "为了成为那种充满杏奈风格、只属于杏奈的偶像。我们一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "fa23581e53fe9406a0ce31ec30562a6c14bec260731ed8ccc83666559ac820a3", "ja": "プロデューサーさん……！　あの……、あのっ！", "zh": "制作人先生……！那个……那个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "0863dd76609b370334c114a1b00361ea55f4f25af90af8d38ddb2e6333d6f865", "ja": "イエーイ！　ありがとう、プロデューサーさん！\n杏奈、ビビッと頑張りまーす！！", "zh": "耶——！谢谢制作人！\n杏奈会活力满满地加油的——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_024ann_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_024ann_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "8f6c613eca749a5411c80d658cff22d58aba72a7dfdd9c3148f8d1f68110d899", "ja": "ああ杏奈！？　ここで頑張るのはちょっと！\nああっ、すみません！　すみませーん！！", "zh": "啊，杏奈！？在这里努力有点不太合适！  \n啊，对不起！对不——起！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
